 "data_gaps": [
  "This is TOTAL water storage (groundwater + soil moisture + snow + surface water). It is not groundwater: separating the groundwater share needs a land-surface model to subtract the other terms, which is not done here.",
  "The solution is built on ~3 degree (~300 km) mascons. Treat the county value as a regional signal that has been interpolated to this location, not a local measurement.",
  "Anomalies are relative to the 2004-2009 mean, so the level is arbitrary; only the shape and the trend carry information.",
  "Trend length matters: this period spans a wet 2019 and dry 2012-2013 and 2022, and starting or ending on a drought year moves the slope. Read it with the series.",
  "GRACE and GRACE-FO have a data gap between missions (2017-2018); no months are interpolated across it."
 ]
